W0W\n06hS46MoIwH+3++PtfYxIeZ9g3OMriQqr654p80QgzACg9awiKEuUrZXgDxo\n4oTG\r\n=UNiL\r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\n","integrity":"sha512-za5vTLuPF9nmrVOovYQwNEWE/PwJCM+yHMAj4xN1WWUvtq9OElsvKiPL0CR9rO8xhrYqL7NpI7IknqR8r6eYOg==","signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEQCIDhJJZXHLTmatHr56XZrdHsOAWFMiLZml8jDXfBSewp2AiAGTAhQSj8A8OmDSSdns+dM9r4oDdC/J9ScX4nNIoigqw=="}]},"maintainers":[{"name":"tmcw","email":"tom@macwright.org"}],"_npmOperationalInternal":{"host":"packages-16-east.internal.npmjs.com","tmp":"tmp/wellknown-0.5.0.tgz_1469221459300_0.13867555488832295"},"directories":{}}},"readme":"[![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/mapbox/wellknown.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/mapbox/wellknown) [![Coverage Status](https://coveralls.io/repos/mapbox/wellknown/badge.svg)](https://coveralls.io/r/mapbox/wellknown)\n\n# wellknown\n\nParse & stringify [Well-Known Text](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Well-known_text) into [GeoJSON](http://www.geojson.org/).\n\nSupport\n\n* Point + MultiPoint\n* LineString + MultiLineString\n* Polygon + MultiPolygon\n* GeometryCollection\n* 2D, 3D, 4D geometries\n\n## cli\n\ninstall:\n\n    $ npm install -g wellknown\n\nuse:\n\n    $ echo \"MultiPoint(0 0, 1 1, 3 3)\" | wellknown > multipoint.geojson\n\n## usage\n\nthis is a node-style module that works in node.js via npm and in browsers via\n[browserify](https://github.com/substack/node-browserify) or a standalone package:\n\n**npm install**:\n\n    npm install wellknown\n\n**bower install**:\n\n    bower install wellknown --save\n\n**standalone**:\n\n    wget https://raw.github.com/mapbox/wellknown/master/wellknown.js\n\n## api\n\n### `parse(wkt)`\n\nGiven WKT as a string, return a GeoJSON [geometry object](http://geojson.org/geojson-spec.html#geometry-objects)\nor `null` if parse fails.\n\n### `stringify(geojson)`\n\nGiven a GeoJSON geometry object or Feature object, return a WKT representation\nas a string. Throws an error if given a `FeatureCollection` or unknown input.\n\n## example\n\n```js\nvar parse = require('wellknown');\n\nparse('POINT(1 2)');\n```\n\n#### Integrating with Leaflet\n\n```js\n// With Leaflet or MapBox.js\nvar geojsonLayer = L.geoJson(parse('Point(1 2)'));\n```\n\n## See Also\n\n* [wicket](https://github.com/arthur-e/Wicket)\n* [openlayers wkt](https://github.com/openlayers/openlayers/blob/master/lib/OpenLayers/Format/WKT.js)\n* [geomet](https://github.com/geomet/geomet) converts between GeoJSON and WKT in Python\n\n## Rant\n\nThe 'WKT Standard' is (mis)managed by the [OGC](http://www.opengeospatial.org/),\nand thus is available on page 52 of [this PDF](http://www.opengeospatial.org/standards/sfa).\n\nGiven the inaccessibility of the standard, there are no direct reference to it\nin this code.\n","maintainers":[{"email":"accounts@mapbox.com","name":"mapbox-admin"}],"time":{"modified":"2022-11-18T07:55:54.984Z","created":"2013-09-09T14:59:22.494Z","0.0.0":"2013-09-09T14:59:23.985Z","0.1.0":"2013-09-10T16:55:01.077Z","0.1.1":"2013-10-09T18:39:01.051Z","0.1.2":"2013-10-29T22:20:03.846Z","0.1.3":"2014-05-19T21:01:45.378Z","0.2.0":"2014-05-21T21:38:35.246Z","0.3.0":"2014-10-03T14:20:53.357Z","0.3.1":"2015-01-03T04:05:57.318Z","0.3.2":"2015-08-25T13:16:16.156Z","0.3.3":"2015-09-11T01:45:43.946Z","0.3.4":"2015-09-11T01:48:44.298Z","0.4.0":"2015-09-16T05:58:18.358Z","0.4.1":"2016-02-09T23:03:06.133Z","0.4.2":"2016-05-10T19:37:24.181Z","0.5.0":"2016-07-22T21:04:21.464Z"},"author":{"name":"Tom MacWright"},"keywords":["wkt","geojson","maps"],"license":"BSD","readmeFilename":"README.md","homepage":"https://github.com/mapbox/wellknown#readme","repository":{"type":"git","url":"git+https://github.com/mapbox/wellknown.git"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/mapbox/wellknown/issues"},"users":{"jawish":true,"acollins-ts":true,"nbuchanan":true,"lius971125":true}}